# Sequence

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Login
    accDescr: The user logs in
    participant U as User
    participant S as Server
    U->>S: Send password
    S-->>U: Token
    Note right of S: Checks the hash
    alt valid
        S->>U: Welcome
    else invalid
        S->>U: Error
    end
```
